Package: hone-listener
Version: @VERSION@
Architecture: @ARCH@
Maintainer: Shin Devlin <shindevlin@proton.me>
Depends: ffmpeg, ca-certificates, systemd, passwd
Section: sound
Priority: optional
Homepage: https://honemesh.net/listener/
Description: Ornigo bird listener (a HONE app)
 Turns this computer's microphone, or a home IP camera's, into a bird listener. Pulls only the
 camera's audio track, drops any sound with a human voice (only a count is
 kept), identifies birds with Perch v2 on this computer and sends a short
 signed bird report every 15 minutes. No audio is ever saved or sent.
